# PaisaVasool — Payment Intake & Matching Service

## Test Documentation

**Version:** 1.0
**Base URL:** `/api/v1/payment_intake_matching`

---

# 1. Overview

This service covers:

* Document upload & background processing (RQ)
* LLM-based extraction (text + vision)
* Payment ↔ Invoice matching
* Dashboard & discrepancy reporting
* Aging & reminder scheduling
* Scheduler management

⚠️ All endpoints require **Bearer token** unless specified.

---

# 2. Document Endpoints

## 2.1 Upload Document

POST `/documents/upload?document_type=INVOICE|PAYMENT`

* Auth: Required
* Content-Type: multipart/form-data
* Max size: 10MB

### Test Cases

```
Valid INVOICE → 200
{ "status": "PROCESSING", "job_id": "...", "document_id": ... }

Valid PAYMENT → 200
File > 10MB → 413
Missing file → 422
Invalid type → 422
No auth → 401/403
```

---

## 2.2 Job Status

GET `/documents/jobs/{job_id}/status`

```
PROCESSING → 200
{ status: "PROCESSING" }

EXTRACTED → 200
{ status: "EXTRACTED", records_count: N }

FAILED → 200
{ status: "FAILED", error: "..." }
```

---

## 2.3 Get Documents

GET `/documents/`

```
Documents exist → 200 [ ... ]
No documents → 200 []
No auth → 401/403
```

---

## 2.4 Get Document

GET `/documents/{document_id}`

```
Found → 200
Not found → 404
```

---

## 2.5 Get Invoices

GET `/documents/{document_id}/invoices`

```
Exists → 200 [ ... ]
None → 200 []
Not found → 500
```

---

## 2.6 Get Payments

GET `/documents/{document_id}/payments`

```
Exists → 200
None → 404
```

---

## 2.7 Save Records

POST `/documents/{document_id}/save`

Body:

```
{
  "document_type": "INVOICE | PAYMENT",
  "records": [...]
}
```

```
Valid → 200
Empty → 400
Duplicate → 409
Not found → 404
```

---

## 2.8 Stats

GET `/documents/stats`

```
200 → aggregated stats
```

---

## 2.9 Delete Invoice

DELETE `/documents/invoices/{invoice_id}`

```
Success → 200
Not found → 404
```

---

## 2.10 Delete Payment

DELETE `/documents/payments/{payment_id}`

```
Success → 200
Not found → 404
```

---

