---

# 6. Matching Logic

| Step | Strategy   | Behaviour   | Disqualify |
| ---- | ---------- | ----------- | ---------- |
| 1    | Invoice No | Match check | YES        |
| 2    | Customer   | Similarity  | NO         |
| 3    | Currency   | Match       | YES        |
| 4    | Amount     | Score       | NO         |
| 5    | Balance    | Bonus       | NO         |

---

# 7. Validation Rules

## Upload

* type must be INVOICE/PAYMENT → 422
* file required → 422
* size ≤ 10MB → 413

## Save Records

* document must exist → 404
* records not empty → 400
* duplicates → 409

## Aging Config

* severity unique → 409
* required fields → 422

## Recent Matches

* limit 1–100 → 400

---

# 8. Notes

* JWT required for most endpoints
* RQ worker must run → otherwise jobs stay PROCESSING
* Redis required → for job status
* LLM keys required → otherwise extraction fails
* Scheduler settings stored in DB
* Soft deletes excluded from queries

---
